{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">靚仔小生周嘉洛今日（7日）迎來 31 歲生日！事業心極重的他即使在生日正日依然心繫工作，堅守崗位繼續開工，夥拍好友葉蒨文及焦浩軒一同拍攝節目《好嘢港多啲》，表現相當敬業。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"05096d5f-5270-4572-bb5f-4dbf505893fa.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026MRIMnEUOXt1791365346.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"05096d5f-5270-4572-bb5f-4dbf505893fa.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">向來人見人愛的周嘉洛在圈中人緣極佳，在下午午膳時間更獲連環驚喜！除了《好嘢港多啲》製作組特意為他準備生日蛋糕慶祝外，龔嘉欣、樊亦敏及陳浚霆亦驚喜現身送上生日蛋糕，讓這位壽星仔一次過收到多份甜絲絲的祝福。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c7465b57-dcbb-4ffc-8348-60506006339d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20269yHrpx6npI1791365345.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c7465b57-dcbb-4ffc-8348-60506006339d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">此外，電視城 Canteen 的一眾同事亦十分有心，齊聲高唱生日歌送給周嘉洛，現場歡呼聲不斷，場面非常熱鬧，盡顯他在台前幕後的超高人氣與好人緣！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T10:19:06.701027+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}